{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"附錄[一]唯識二十論頌","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"[二]若識無實境.　卽處時決定　相續不決定　作用不應成。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"處時定如夢.　身不定如鬼同見膿河等.　如夢損有用。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"一切如地獄.　同見獄卒等　能爲逼害事.　故四義皆成。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"如天上傍生　地獄中不爾.　所執傍生鬼　不受彼苦故。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"若許由業力　有異大種生　起如是轉變.　於識何不許。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"業熏習餘處　執餘處有果.所熏識有果　不許有何因。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"依彼所化生　世尊密意趣　說有色等處.　如化生有情。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"識從自種生　似境相而轉.　爲成內外處　佛說彼爲十。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"依此教能入數取趣無我.所執法無我復依餘教入。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"以彼境非一.　亦非多極微.　又非和合等.　極微不成故。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"[一]藏譯別有此本．題曰二十頌．n~i-c#u-pah!itshig-leh!urbyas-pa．爲唯識二十論本．前出論文乃其釋也．奘譯不傳．今由前論錄出備考．","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"[二]藏本前有卽是等唯識無義似現故譬如有瞖者見髮月無物一頌．奘譯缺略．","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"極微與六合　一應成六分.　若與六同處　聚應如極微。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"極微旣無合　聚有合者誰.　或相合不成　不由無方分。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"極微有方分理不應成一.無應影障無.聚不異.無二。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"一應無次行.　俱時至未至.　及多有間事.　幷難見細物。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"現覺如夢等.　已起現覺時　見及境已無.　寧許有現量。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"如說似境識.從此生憶念。未覺不能知夢所見非有。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"展轉增上力.　二識成決定。心由睡眠壞.夢覺果不同。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"由他識轉變　有殺害事業.如鬼等意力　令他失念等。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"彈宅迦等空雲何由仙忿.意罰爲大罪此復雲何成。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"他心智雲何　知境不如實.　如知自心智.　不知如佛境。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_190_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_190","text":"我已隨自能　略成唯識義.　此中一切種　難思.佛所行。","sortOrder":26}],"overrides":{}}